Automatic configuration rollback plugin for OPNsense.

Safe Mode snapshots the running configuration before you change it. If
you do not confirm your changes within a configurable timeout, the
system reverts to the last known-good configuration.

Features:

* Timer-based auto-revert with configurable timeout (default 120 seconds)
* Live countdown with confirm, extend, and revert controls on the plugin page
* CLI confirmation via configctl for SSH users
* Dashboard widget showing current status
* Git backup integration when os-git-backup is installed
* Rollback method: full reboot or service reload

Inspired by Juniper JUNOS "commit confirmed" and MikroTik Safe Mode.

